; A recursive tree type whose cycle runs through a DIRECT struct member
; (`x` names `x`), not through a scalar alias as recursive.hbnf's does.  The
; visit_/fold_ walkers only descend into a struct member, so this is the
; fixture that makes the Rust backend walk through its box (RFCPLAN step 9b).
language C
include "../../grammars/obconf.hbnf"

x = '(' x ')' | '(' int ')'
